{"type":"text","timestamp":1794527624428,"sessionID":"ses_e2dd383dbffeemFt0Z1HPJmU6U","part":{"id":"prt_1d22e6efd0027EEc7h25ODXoNP","sessionID":"ses_e2dd383dbffeemFt0Z1HPJmU6U","messageID":"msg_1d22e64e90014KkkDD5Vkzy3po","type":"text","text":"T020 is done.\n\n## Files written\n\n1. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs` (`D`)\n   - Deleted `renderDoctorCommandStrings(entries)`.\n   - Deleted the `RENDER_PATH`, `RENDER_GENERATED_START` and `RENDER_GENERATED_END` constants, which only that block needed.\n   - Deleted the `RENDER_PATH` entry from `generatedSources`, along with its `readFileSync` of `render.ts`.\n\n2. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts` (`R`)\n   - Deleted the whole `// BEGIN GENERATED DOCTOR COMMANDS` … `// END GENERATED DOCTOR COMMANDS` block, including the `DOCTOR_COMMAND_STRINGS` table and the comment describing it. `DOCTOR_BRIDGE_PREFIX` / `isDoctorBridgeId` remain, since they still have live readers.\n\n3. Ran `node $D` — nothing else needed regeneration (`changed: []`).\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n--- rg ---\nrg exit=1                    # no matches for GENERATED DOCTOR COMMANDS|renderDoctorCommandStrings in $D $R\n--- check ---\nfresh\n```\n\n```\n$ npm run typecheck\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\n\ntypecheck exit=0\n```\n\nAlso confirmed `node --check` on the deriver exits 0.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `$ADV/tests/doctor-command-bridges.vitest.ts` still asserts on the `BEGIN/END GENERATED DOCTOR COMMANDS` markers in `render.ts` (lines 136-137). That file is T024's scope, not T020's, so I left it untouched; it will fail until T024 lands.\n- The T020 checkbox in `tasks.md` was left unticked as instructed.\n- Nothing was committed, and no file outside `D` and `R` was modified by me.","time":{"start":1794527620861,"end":1794527624428}}}
